{"id":"23ff9924b78abec3","group":"58","path":"58/batch08/58-df-zfc-order12-order-product-carrier.md","title":"ZFC Order12 Order Product Carrier","display":"df-zfc-order12-order-product-carrier — ZFC Order12 Order Product Carrier","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-order12-order-product-carrier","aliases":["58-df-zfc-order12-order-product-carrier"],"display":"df-zfc-order12-order-product-carrier — ZFC Order12 Order Product Carrier","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-order12-order-product-carrier"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-order12-order-product-carrier</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-order12-order-product-carrier — ZFC Order12 Order Product Carrier"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P,I,F,g,i,B\\in V\">\\(P,I,F,g,i,B\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcOrder12OrderProductCarrier}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcOrder12OrderProductCarrier}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order12\\text{-}order\\text{-}product\\text{-}carrier} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcOrder12OrderProductCarrier}_S(P,I,F)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists B\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(F,I,B)\n\\land P=\\{g\\in\\mathcal P(I\\times\\bigcup B):\n\\mathrm{Function}(g,I,\\bigcup B)\\land\n\\forall i\\in I\\;(g(i)\\in F(i))\\}\n\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order12\\text{-}order\\text{-}product\\text{-}carrier} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcOrder12OrderProductCarrier}_S(P,I,F)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists B\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(F,I,B)\n\\land P=\\{g\\in\\mathcal P(I\\times\\bigcup B):\n\\mathrm{Function}(g,I,\\bigcup B)\\land\n\\forall i\\in I\\;(g(i)\\in F(i))\\}\n\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The family has a set codomain, and the product is bounded inside a power set.</li>\n<li>Empty factors are allowed, in which case the product carrier is empty.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch16/58-df-function.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"P,I,F,g,i,B\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcOrder12OrderProductCarrier}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order12\\text{-}order\\text{-}product\\text{-}carrier} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcOrder12OrderProductCarrier}_S(P,I,F)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists B\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(F,I,B)\n\\land P=\\{g\\in\\mathcal P(I\\times\\bigcup B):\n\\mathrm{Function}(g,I,\\bigcup B)\\land\n\\forall i\\in I\\;(g(i)\\in F(i))\\}\n\\Bigr)","display":true}],"bytes":1129,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2920","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-df-zfc-order12-order-product-carrier.md|58-df-zfc-order12-order-product-carrier]]（batch08）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","36d7463d215be751"]}